/**
 * Validate server-side referential integrity when creating product options with
 * nonexistent product IDs.
 *
 * This test attempts to create a product option (variant) with a
 * random/nonexistent product ID, ensuring that the API correctly rejects the
 * request with an appropriate error. The business objective is to guarantee
 * that sellers cannot create product options for products that do not exist,
 * preserving catalog consistency.
 *
 * Step-by-step:
