 * 3. The API should return the post with updated fields, the updated_at timestamp
 *    should be refreshed, and all properties should persist.
 * 4. After update, the test will confirm:
 *
 *    - The title and body have changed as expected.
 *    - Updated_at is after created_at (or at least different).
 *    - Id, channel, section, and author are unchanged.
 *    - The post was not soft-deleted (deleted_at is null or absent).
