 * This test ensures that a customer searching for BBS (forum) posts only sees
 * posts authored by others that are visible and belong to sections/channels the
 * customer is permitted to view. It verifies that posts which are either
 * deleted (soft-deleted) or in restricted/private sections are not returned in
