/**
 * Test retrieval of paginated policy change/version audit records as an admin
 * (compliance workflow).
 *
 * This test validates that:
 *
 * - Policy history/version records can be retrieved successfully by an admin
 * - The response enforces correct pagination contract (pagination meta + data
 *   array)
 * - Only admins can access this endpoint (admin-only permission is enforced)
 * - Returned items (if any) are valid summaries of policy version modifications,
 *   fitting business compliance audit workflows
 *
 * Step-by-step process:
 *
 * 1. Call the policy changes index endpoint as an (already authenticated) admin
 * 2. Validate shape, presence, types and structure of pagination and data
 * 3. (Optional, Negative) Confirm that access without proper admin credentials
 *    fails
