 * 3. Attempt, as the (current) customer, to delete that non-owned comment using
 *    its UUID
 * 4. Validate that the system throws an error for forbidden operation (e.g.,
 *    permission denied)
 * 5. (Limitation) Cannot assert the persistence or visibility of the comment
