 *
 * This test verifies that after a seller has created a BBS post, and there are
 * several comments (including replies and different authors), the seller can
 * retrieve all non-deleted comments for that post, including the
 * threading/nesting structure, in a paginated format.
 *
 * Steps:
 *
 * 1. Seller creates a BBS post
 * 2. Seed the post with multiple comments: a) Seller writes a top-level comment b)
 *    Simulate a customer writing another top-level comment (as role switching
 *    is unavailable, same session is used) c) Seller replies to the customer
 *    comment
 * 3. Fetch the comments list as the seller
 * 4. Validate:
 *
 *    - All seeded (non-deleted) comments are present
 *    - Threading (parent/child) relationships are correct
 *    - All returned comments have deleted_at === null
 *    - Pagination data is present and valid
 */
export async function test_api_shopping_mall_ai_test_list_bbs_comments_for_bbs_post_with_authorized_seller(
