 * shopping_mall_ai_file_attachments by its UUID. The deletion is hard (the
 * record is removed from the table) because no soft delete field exists. Only
 * authenticated admins are permitted to perform this action. All deletions are
 * logged in the compliance audit log shopping_mall_ai_audit_logs for
 * traceability and legal compliance.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.admin - Authenticated admin user performing the deletion
 * @param props.fileAttachmentId - UUID of the file attachment to delete
 * @returns Void (no response body)
