 * Enforces strict RBAC: only the order's owning customer may retrieve payment
 * history.
 *
 * This enables compliance/financial review, refunds, BI export, and dashboard
 * access.
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.customer - The authenticated customer performing the request
 * @param props.orderId - The ID of the order whose payments to list
 * @returns Paginated list of payments for the specific order
 * @throws {Error} If the order does not exist or does not belong to the
