 * with the current ISO timestamp, performing a logical (soft) delete. This
 * operation is restricted to authenticated administrators. If the record is not
 * found or already deleted, an error is thrown. No data is physically removed;
 * the record remains available for compliance audit and potential system
 * recovery.
